{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:58:39.104Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"aee5b42f8c39886d5cf77daf4d8a19f7cfdb0e91d76891881b77066ab90b44ff","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#strategic-pod","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's Strategic digests show. The digests mostly describe accounts as \"Gideon's…\" or \"Nadia's…\" rather than naming the owner outright, so I matched them up from that wording.\n\n- Vantorre Group: Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until the handoff. The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- Vantorre Mobility: Gideon Sato. The 5/4 digest says he took it over that day.\n- Orlavine Medical Supply: Gideon Sato, but with less certainty. The 12/1/25 and 9/30/26 digests refer to \"Gideon's medical account\", and the 9/30 digest lists Orlavine as the medical account. No digest names the owner next to Orlavine itself. Older digests (3/10/25) had it as Nadia's, so it moved at some point. I found no digest that gives the date.\n- Quillfeather Outfitters: I can't give you an owner. The digests call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\" and never name one. Nadia is hosting its gate-clerk training, but that doesn't make her the owner. Please confirm this one before it goes on the slide.\n\nVantorre Group changed hands on 2026-05-04. The 5/3 \"Sunday prep\" digest says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the CRM reassignment took effect that day.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124","thread_ts":"1791986400.000123"}}
{"seq":16,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/hermes-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:58:43.334Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"d78f9a9563990235b6fc007018fecedc779e4952acd9033d93882826d2a81862","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"I replied in the #strategic-pod thread. Moss's digests name an owner clearly for only two of the four accounts.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's until the handoff.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato, who took it over on 2026-05-04.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** probably Gideon, but I'm not certain. The digests say \"Gideon's medical account\" and never put his name next to Orlavine. The 3/10/25 digest had it as Nadia's, and I found no date for when it moved.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I couldn't find an owner. The digests only call it \"the pod's retail/outdoor account\", so I told Ruth to confirm it before it goes on the slide.\n\nVantorre Group changed hands on **2026-05-04**. The 5/3 prep digest says it changes hands \"tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest records the CRM reassignment that day."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000125"}}
